# The mode of each of agent-check's default checks. A line is a pattern, then a mode:
#   block    sent back to the model, as a repo's own check-fast findings are
#   notify   told to the person, once, and not sent to the model
#   observe  only logged, to ~/.local/state/agent-check/findings.jsonl
# A pattern is language/rule, a language, or *; the most specific line wins.
#
# A check starts at observe and moves up once `agent-check replay DIR` shows it's quiet on the repos' history
# (the end-of-turn hooks plan, 2026-11-24). A language whose findings are all observed skips its tier-1 steps
# (builds, type checks, tests): nobody would see what they found.
common/gitleaks      block
common/merge-marker  block
*                    observe
